      "title": "[正面] This game is incredible. The story made me cry and...",
      "summary": "This game is incredible. The story made me cry and laugh, the characters are beautiful, tasteful and stylish in all the right ways. The music is just incredible, the ost is just lovely. The gameplay might just be the best part, every unit is useful, nothing is ever powercrept(so far), i really have no complaints about it. Even the gacha system is very generous, so much so you actually want to support the company lol\r\n\r\nHigly recommend this game for anyone that's a fan of horror, mystery and magic",
